{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119142","id":3614544806,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7XcZOm","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119142","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119142.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119142.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119142","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119142/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119142/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119142/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bd410922a3270f5cc77483eb067b673dd9844d75","number":119142,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add `Input.get_device_orientation()` returning hardware-fused quaternion","user":{"login":"lxdua","id":164756965,"node_id":"U_kgDOCdH95Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164756965?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxdua","html_url":"https://github.com/lxdua","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxdua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxdua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxdua/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxdua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxdua/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxdua/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxdua/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxdua/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lxdua/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14704\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\nAdds `Input.get_device_orientation()` returning a `Quaternion` representing the\r\ndevice's absolute orientation, sourced from system-level hardware sensor fusion\r\non mobile platforms. Fills the gap between Godot and Unity's `Input.gyro.attitude`.\r\n\r\n## Implementation\r\n\r\n**Android**: `TYPE_GAME_ROTATION_VECTOR` (preferred) → `TYPE_ROTATION_VECTOR`\r\n(fallback). The quaternion from `SensorManager.getQuaternionFromVector()` is\r\ncorrected for the current screen rotation, then mapped from the Android sensor\r\ncoordinate system to Godot's convention at the `DisplayServerAndroid` bridge.\r\n\r\n**iOS / Apple Embedded**: `CMDeviceMotion.attitude.quaternion`, with per-screen-\r\norientation correction quaternions in `godot_view_apple_embedded.mm`.\r\n\r\n**Other platforms**: returns `Quaternion()` (identity).\r\n\r\n## API\r\n\r\n- New method: `Input.get_device_orientation() -> Quaternion`\r\n- New project setting: `input_devices/sensors/enable_device_orientation` (default `false`)\r\n- Both documented in `doc/classes/Input.xml` and `doc/classes/ProjectSettings.xml`\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nVerified on a Redmi Turbo 5 Max (Android, arm64) in landscape:\r\n- 1:1 match between physical phone rotation and a 3D mesh driven by the API\r\n- Smooth at slow & fast rotation, no jitter\r\n- No drift over ~5 minutes of continuous use\r\n- Default-disabled: returns identity when project setting is off\r\n\r\n> ⚠️ I do not have access to an iOS device. The iOS code path follows the same\r\n> pattern as the existing accelerometer/gyro handling in `handleMotion` and\r\n> compiles, but real-device verification is needed before merging. Help testing\r\n> on iOS is appreciated.\r\n\r\n## Default behavior\r\n\r\nDisabled by default (battery-friendly), opt-in via project setting — identical\r\nto the existing `enable_gyroscope` / `enable_magnetometer` pattern.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptio